## Active G4 blocker — source-sheet boundary authority

Read-only immutable-source diagnosis shows the curved-disk producer's internal local-boundary check accepts a full-source internal edge only when it is marked hard. That is narrower than source-sheet authority.

`classify_source_surface_labels()` can create a sheet boundary across a non-hard internal source edge when normal compatibility or close/opposing-sheet separation blocks traversal. `SurfaceCellTracingOptions` already carries authoritative component/sheet labels, and `source_faces_compatible()` already expresses same-sheet compatibility.

The next Code + Build must make the smallest general correction:

1. retain genuine source-boundary edges;
2. retain hard-feature internal boundaries;
3. for a non-hard internal local boundary, accept only when the opposite source face belongs to a different authoritative component/sheet;
4. continue to reject hidden ordinary cuts whose two source incident faces share the same authoritative component/sheet;
5. preserve exact source-edge/face/component/sheet provenance;
6. do not mutate the source classifier or hard-feature set merely to obtain acceptance.

Execute `.agents/Directional/Gate_4_Closed_Genus_One_Source_Sheet_Boundary_Authority_Code_Build_Plan.md` as **Code + Build only**.

